# PowerShell Execution

## Detection ID
DET-001

## Description
Identifies PowerShell process creation on monitored Windows endpoints.

## Data Source
- Microsoft Sysmon
- Event ID 1: Process Creation

## MITRE ATT&CK
- T1059.001 — PowerShell

## Detection Logic
Searches for Sysmon process-creation events containing powershell.exe.

## Expected Benign Activity
- Administrative scripts
- Troubleshooting commands
- Software installation
- IT automation

## Potentially Suspicious Activity
- Encoded commands
- Hidden PowerShell windows
- Downloads from external locations
- Execution from unusual parent processes
- Commands launched by Office applications

## Validation
Tested using benign PowerShell commands on WIN11-01.

## Status
Operational — requires tuning.
